 151,2m</witsml:comments></witsml:activity><witsml:activity><witsml:dTimStart>2016-07-05T22:25:00+02:00</witsml:dTimStart><witsml:dTimEnd>2016-07-05T23:15:00+02:00</witsml:dTimEnd><witsml:md uom="m">151</witsml:md><witsml:phase>fixed</witsml:phase><witsml:proprietaryCode>plug abandon -- perforate</witsml:proprietaryCode><witsml:state>ok</witsml:state><witsml:stateDetailActivity>success</witsml:stateDetailActivity><witsml:comments>Staged up pumps to 1350 lpm, circulated for 10 min, took returns through the choke. Max H2S in returns 13 ppm on Baker sensors in gas trap. Flow checked well on choke, stable. Opened upper pipe ram. Flow checked well for 10 min. Stable.</witsml:comments></witsml:activity><witsml:activity><witsml:dTimStart>2016-07-05T23:15:00+02:00</witsml:dTimStart><witsml:dTimEnd>2016-07-06T00:00:00+02:00</witsml:dTimEnd><witsml:md uom="m">0</witsml:md><witsml:phase>fixed</witsml:phase><witsml:proprietaryCode>plug abandon -- perforate</witsml:proprietaryCode><witsml:state>ok</witsml:state><witsml:stateDetailActivity>success</witsml:stateDetailActivity><witsml:comments>POOH w/ perforation BHA, 3x stands and 1x single</witsml:comments></witsml:activity>
